The network (src/umx.rs) and the Wiener filter (src/wiener.rs) follow
Open-Unmix for PyTorch (https://github.com/sigsep/open-unmix-pytorch,
openunmix/model.py and openunmix/filtering.py). The model weights it reads
(UMX-HQ vocals, Zenodo record 3370489) are under the same MIT license.

